THIRD-PARTY MODEL ATTRIBUTION

The fine-tuned model distributed at:

artifacts/centralized_finetuning/mobilenetv4_small_quickdraw10.safetensors

is derived from the following pretrained model:

Model: MobileNetV4-Conv-Small-0.5
Identifier: mobilenetv4_conv_small_050.e3000_r224_in1k
Pretrained weights: Ross Wightman
Source: https://huggingface.co/timm/mobilenetv4_conv_small_050.e3000_r224_in1k
License: Apache License 2.0

The original ImageNet-1k classification head was replaced with a ten-class classifier, and the complete network was subsequently fine-tuned on the Google Quick, Draw! dataset by Indigma Innovations.

